#: includes/class-mgcpg-settings.php:272
msgid "This plugin connects your store to the MyGate payment service at app.mygate.me. When a shopper starts a payment, the plugin sends the checkout amount, currency, an encrypted order reference, your public MyGate checkout key (pk_live_), the return URL, and a short order note to MyGate so the payment page can be created and matched to the local order. The private MyGate API key (sk_live_) remains on the WordPress server and is used only for authenticated server-to-server payment status checks. If a webhook is delayed or blocked, the plugin may query the MyGate API from the WordPress server to verify the exact payment reference and completed transaction status."
msgstr ""

